1
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:08,430
"We've got 3 minutes till it blows. We won't make it!"
反應爐3分鐘後就要爆炸

2
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,630
"You've got to get out of here! Save yourself!"
我們逃不掉了 你得趕快逃命

4
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,810
"I won't leave you."
不行，我不會扔下你

5
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:19,450
"Don't worry about me. I'm a robot. I'm just a machine!"
別管我 我是機器人，我只是一台機器

7
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:24,790
-"No,you're not. Not to me." -Oh,my God.
對我來說不是 天哪

8
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,980
-What? -I am extremely talented.
怎樣？ 我太有才華了

10
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,650
-Yeah. You're great. -Yeah.
你確很棒

11
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:34,820
-Okay,let's take it from.. -No,I mean, I was really acting my ass off.
好，我們從… 不是，我真的超會演的

12
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,660
I thought I was pretty good,too.
我覺得我也很不錯

13
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,660
Yeah,you're solid. You're just no me.
你是很不錯，只不過不是我

14
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,460
You know what? I think that's enough for now.
我看就先這樣 

15
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:47,270
I don't want to be over-rehearsed.
我不想排練過頭

16
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,310
Fine. I'll do it without you!
沒關係，我自己演

17
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,400
I don't need you or anybody else!
我不需要你或任何人

18
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:55,880
I'm gonna make it on my own!
我會靠我自己成功

19
00:00:57,590 --> 00:01:00,350
You'll see! You'll all see!
等著瞧，都給我等著瞧

20
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,620
The One With Mac and C.H.E.E.S.E.
本集播出：「試鏡風波」

00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,620
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:01:39,990 --> 00:01:42,620
So what are you auditioning for?
你要去試什麼鏡？

22
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:44,090
It's a new TV show.
是一部新影集

23
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:48,760
I'm up for the part of Mac, Machiavelli, or "Mac"!
我的角色叫麥克麥可維利 也叫麥克

24
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:53,970
I'm a detective and I solve crimes with my robot partner.
我是個偵探 和我的機器人拍檔 一起打擊犯罪

26
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:56,540
He's a computerized humanoid...
他是人性化電腦

27
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:59,870
electronically enhanced secret enforcer.
電子秘密殺手

28
00:02:00,050 --> 00:02:02,540
Or "C.H.E.E.S.E."
簡稱吉事

29
00:02:03,850 --> 00:02:08,120
-So Mac and C.H.E.E.S.E.? -That's the title!
麥克與吉事 那就是劇名

31
00:02:09,990 --> 00:02:13,390
They lucked out that the initials spell "cheese."
幸好縮寫剛好是吉事

32
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,120
That is lucky.
真是幸好

33
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:19,000
So Joey,if you get this, you're gonna be,like...
要是你拿到這個角色

34
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,860
the star of your own TV show.
就有你自己的影集了

35
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:25,510
I mean,you'll be like the "Big Cheese" or the "Big Mac." Hey, you love those!
你就會被稱為大吉事（漢堡） 或是大麥克（麥香堡） 都是你的最愛

37
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:29,240
Don't get your hopes up. It probably won't happen.
別抱太大期望，應該沒那麼好

38
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,110
Why would you say that?
你為什麼要這麼說？

39
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:34,340
Well,I mean, come on, guys. My own TV show?
拜託，我主演的影集耶？

40
00:02:34,550 --> 00:02:37,310
-I don't know if I'm good enough. -I am.
我都不知道我配不配 我配

42
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:42,350
What are you talking about? You're a terrific actor.
喬伊，你在說什麼？ 你是個很棒的演員

43
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:46,690
-You really think so? -How can you even ask that question?
真的嗎？ 你怎麼能這麼問

45
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:50,790
-She's pretty. -Yeah. And she's really nice too.
她真漂亮 對，人也很好

47
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,090
She taught me all about how to work with cameras...
她教我怎麼面對鏡頭 

48
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:57,030
and "smell the fart" acting.
和聞屁演技法

49
00:02:59,210 --> 00:03:01,070
-I'm sorry. What? -Excuse me?
什麼？

50
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:05,040
It's like you got so many lines to learn so fast...
因為在短時間內要背很多台詞

51
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:08,180
sometimes you need time to remember your next one.
有時得停下來想下一句

52
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:13,450
So while you're thinking of it, you take this pause where you look intense.
在你想的時候 要來個大停頓，表情故作嚴肅

53
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:15,590
You know, like this:
就像這樣

54
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,960
Okay.
好

55
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,420
Here's my scene! Here's my scene!
該我了該我了

56
00:03:23,130 --> 00:03:26,790
Mrs. Wallace? I'm Dr. Drake Ramorey, your sister's surgeon.
華勒斯太太，我是拉莫瑞醫生 令妹的神經外科醫生

57
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:30,240
You sister is suffering from a...
令妹得了一種…

58
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:39,770
Well,Eva,we've done some excellent work here.
伊娃，偶們有不湊的進展 （我們有不錯的進展）

59
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:46,480
And I would have to say your problem is quite clear.
老俗唆，你的困老很清此 （老實說，你的困擾很清楚）

60
00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:52,150
All you want is a tinkle
你只是想要一個老二

61
00:03:52,930 --> 00:03:55,260
What you envy's a schwang
你在忌妒男人

62
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:58,890
A thing through which you can tinkle
你想要拿它來撒尿

63
00:03:59,330 --> 00:04:02,000
Or play with or simply let hang
或是把玩，或是掛在那邊

64
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,570
I play Al Pacino's butt.
我演艾爾帕西諾的屁股

65
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,830
All right?
好嗎？

66
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:11,840
He goes into the shower and then, I'm his butt.
他進去淋浴 然後我就是他的屁股

67
00:04:12,050 --> 00:04:14,540
-Oh,my God. -Come on,you guys.
-天哪 -別這樣

68
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:18,080
This is a movie and Al Pacino's in it, and that's big!
這是一部電影 艾爾帕西諾主演，很不得了

69
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:22,150
It's terrific. You deserve this. After years of struggling...
的確很棒 你當之無愧，努力了這麼久

71
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:25,950
you've finally cracked your way into show business.
終於可以「屁美」別人了

72
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:33,030
Okay,fine, make jokes. I don't care. This is a big break for me.
好，你們笑吧，我不在乎 這是我的一大突破

74
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:35,630
-No,you're right,it is. -Yeah.
你說得很對

75
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:38,430
So,you gonna invite us to the big opening?
你會找我們去看你 「精屁」的演出嗎？

76
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:42,940
All right,I'm out of here. Wish me luck.
好，我要走了，祝我好運

77
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:48,100
Good luck,good luck We all wish you good luck
加油，加油，我們祝你好運

78
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:52,250
Yeah,whatever.
隨便啦

79
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:57,080
Wow,if I could dance, I'd be a triple threat.
要是我會跳舞就更可怕了

80
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,430
It's your turn.
該你了

81
00:05:05,470 --> 00:05:07,300
Oh,are we playing this?
我們有在玩喔？

82
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:11,130
How'd the audition go?
試鏡結果如何？ 

83
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:15,540
Terrible. I messed up every word. I shouldn't even be an actor.
很爛 我把台詞都念壞了 我不該當演員的

85
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:20,910
Wait. Are you pretending it didn't go well, but it really did go well?
等等，你又在假裝不順利了嗎

86
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:25,280
-Yeah, did I fool you? -Totally!
-對，有唬過你們嗎？ -一愣一愣的

88
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:29,920
-So it did go well? -Amazingly well!
所以很順利羅 順利得不得了

89
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:33,560
-Great! -It's down to me and two other guys.
太好了 只剩我和另外兩個人三選一 天哪

91
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,890
And they're really good.
那兩個人都很厲害

92
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:39,900
One's from those allergy commercials who's chased by flowers.
其中一個就是在過敏廣告裡 被巨無霸花朵追來追去的人

93
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:41,730
Oh,I love that guy!
我好喜歡那個人

94
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,800
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

95
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:46,700
What am I doing?
我在幹什麼？

96
00:05:48,410 --> 00:05:52,240
I'm so nervous,you know? The callback is tomorrow at 5:00.
我好緊張 明天下午5點才要複試

97
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:57,280
-I feel like my head's gonna explode. -Well,it is overdue.
我的頭好像要爆炸了 你的頭早該爆了

99
00:05:57,450 --> 00:06:01,410
-Don't worry. You'll be fine. -But it's so much pressure.
放心，你一定沒問題 壓力真的好大

100
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:05,750
What you guys do is different. I don't know if you'd understand.
很抱歉，但你們的工作很不同 我不知道你們能不能體會

102
00:06:06,330 --> 00:06:09,730
Yeah,we don't have pressure at our jobs.
是啊，我們的工作都沒有壓力

103
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:14,890
I know what time it is,but I'm looking at the wee-ness and I'm not happy.
我知道現在幾點了 但是我對這份報告很不滿意

104
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,460
Well,I'm tearing the lettuce.
我在撕生菜 

105
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,700
-Is it dirty? -Don't worry,I'll wash it.
它髒嗎？ 放心，我會洗

107
00:06:21,910 --> 00:06:24,040
Don't. I like it dirty.
不必，我喜歡髒的

108
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,310
That's your call.
你決定就好

109
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:31,820
So what are you going to do next?
你接下來要做什麼？

110
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:34,490
I thought I'd cut up the tomatoes.
我要切蕃茄

111
00:06:34,690 --> 00:06:36,950
Are they firm?
它們結實嗎？

112
00:06:39,090 --> 00:06:42,360
-They're all right. -You sure they haven't gone bad?
還不差 你確定它們沒有變壞？ 

114
00:06:42,530 --> 00:06:45,160
You sure they're not very,very bad?
你確定它們不是很壞很壞？

115
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:52,940
-No,really. They're okay. -You gonna slice them real nice?
它們還好 你會把它們切得很漂亮嗎？

117
00:06:53,210 --> 00:06:56,340
Actually,I was gonna do them julienne.
其實我想切絲

118
00:06:57,850 --> 00:06:59,210
I'm out of here.
我要走了

119
00:06:59,410 --> 00:07:03,080
I'm quitting. I just helped an 81-year-old woman put on a thong...
摩妮卡，我要辭職 我幫一個老女人擠進丁字褲

121
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:05,310
and she didn't even buy it.
結果她也沒買

122
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:09,120
I'm quitting. That's it. I'm talking to my boss right now.
我要辭職 我現在就要跟老闆說

123
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:11,380
Yes,I am. Yes,I am.
我要我要我要…

125
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:14,660
Bye. Call me when you get this message.
再見，聽到留言請回電

126
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:16,260
Well,what happened?
怎麼了？

127
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:20,560
Well, he came in for a massage, and everything was fine until...
他來按摩，本來都沒事 後來…

128
00:07:24,070 --> 00:07:25,560
Oh,my God.
天哪

129
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:29,930
And all of a sudden, his hands weren't the problem anymore.
然後突然間毛手毛腳成了小事

130
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,410
-Was it? -Boy Scouts could've camped under there.
他有沒有… 用來搭帳棚都綽綽有餘

132
00:07:38,990 --> 00:07:40,390
You ate my sandwich?
你吃了我的三明治？

133
00:07:40,790 --> 00:07:43,120
It was a mistake. It could happen to anyone.
很單純的錯誤，誰都可能會犯

134
00:07:43,590 --> 00:07:45,530
Really?
是嗎？

135
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,790
Now calm down.
你別激動

136
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:52,130
Come look in my office. Some of it may still be in the trash.
來我的辦公室找 垃圾桶裡可能還有

137
00:07:53,530 --> 00:07:55,700
-What? -Well,it was quite large.
什麼？ 它很大

138
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:58,960
I had to throw most of it away.
我只好扔掉一大半

139
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:02,870
You threw my sandwich away?
你…你扔掉我的三明治

140
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:05,610
My sandwich?
我的三明治

141
00:08:05,810 --> 00:08:08,750
My sandwich!
我的三明治

142
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:12,740
It's just,I want this part so much.
我好想拿到這個角色

143
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:17,250
If I don't get this part, I'm never gonna eat macaroni and cheese again.
要是我沒拿到 我就再也不吃起司通心面

145
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:20,020
I didn't say that. That doesn't count.
不，我沒說，我騙人

146
00:08:24,070 --> 00:08:27,130
Come on,guys. It's not like I moved to Europe.
別這樣，我又不是搬去歐洲

147
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,300
I just moved across the hall.
我只是搬到對面

148
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:31,700
And we would have you over all the time...
我們也想經常請你們來坐 

149
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:35,570
if it weren't for Monica's allergies.
但是摩妮卡會過敏

150
00:08:37,410 --> 00:08:39,780
You're right,I could never lie to you.
沒錯，我騙不了你們

151
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:41,380
She hates you.
她討厭你們

152
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:45,090
Should I get that?
要接嗎？

153
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:52,660
Hello? No,Joey's not here right now. Can I take a message?
你好 喬伊現在不在，你要留言嗎？

155
00:08:53,130 --> 00:08:56,720
Yeah,okay. So the audition's been moved from 5:00 to 2:30?
好，試鏡從5點改到2點半？

156
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:58,900
Okay,great. Bye.
好的，再見

157
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:11,770
-Aren't you dressed yet? -Am I naked again?
你還沒穿衣服？ 我又光著身體了？

159
00:09:13,410 --> 00:09:15,940
We're meeting my parents in 15 minutes.
我們15分鐘後要去見我爸媽

160
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:18,880
I was just talking to the guys. Look at them.
好，我只是在跟它們聊天

161
00:09:19,090 --> 00:09:21,180
Is it okay if they come visit?
你看它們嘛 它們可以去找我們嗎？

162
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,820
What about my allergies?
那我的過敏怎麼辦？

163
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:26,720
Right. Your allergies.
也對，你會過敏

164
00:09:28,930 --> 00:09:30,450
All her. She hates you.
都是她，她討厭你們

165
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:45,310
Yes! All right.
漂亮

166
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:50,750
How cool would it be if you could watch a life-size version of this?
要是這些小人能變成真人大小 該有多酷？

167
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:54,750
-I mean,how crazy would that be? -As crazy as soccer?
該有多過癮？ 跟足球一樣過癮？

169
00:09:59,290 --> 00:10:00,320
Hello?
你好

170
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:04,660
What are you talking about? The audition's at 5.
你在說什麼？5點才試鏡

171
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,670
Well,nobody told me.
沒有人告訴我

172
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,470
Who'd you talk to?
你跟誰說的？

173
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:17,570
Never mind.
沒事

174
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,950
You mean you didn't get it from this?
這樣你看不懂嗎？

175
00:10:21,650 --> 00:10:25,980
-The allergy guy got the part. Thanks. -Maybe we can fix it.
-那個過敏人入選了，謝謝你啊 -也許還可以補救 

177
00:10:26,290 --> 00:10:29,920
Maybe we can send him some big flowers and scare him!
我們可以送巨無霸花去嚇他

178
00:10:30,590 --> 00:10:34,490
How could you do this? This could've turned my career around.
你怎麼能這樣？ 這個角色可以讓我的事業翻紅

179
00:10:34,730 --> 00:10:38,030
I messed up,okay? I'm sorry. I really messed up.
是我不好 對不起，我真的錯了

181
00:10:38,230 --> 00:10:40,600
Why'd you answer my phone?
你根本也不住這裡了 幹嘛接我的電話？

182
00:10:40,770 --> 00:10:44,000
-I have a machine! -Which I bought for you.
-我有答錄機 -是我買給你的

183
00:10:44,570 --> 00:10:47,970
Taught you how to use it. You thought it was a copier.
還教你怎麼使用 你以為它是影印機

185
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:52,270
If there was anything I could do, I'd do it.
我願意盡全力挽救這個錯誤

186
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:55,240
Everybody's allowed one mistake,right?
但是人起碼可以犯一次錯

187
00:10:55,450 --> 00:10:58,350
He could have gotten me a VCR or golf clubs.
他可以送我錄影機 可以送我高爾夫球具

188
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:01,680
But no,he has to get me the "Woman Repeller."
可是他偏偏要讓我把女人嚇跑

189
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:05,590
The eyesore from the "Liberace House of Crap!"
一個廢五金行裡最醜的東西

190
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:08,060
-It's not that bad. -Easy for you to say.
沒那麼嚴重

191
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:12,060
You don't have to sport a reject from the "Mr. T" collection.
你又不必戴著 被某個老粗淘汰的金飾到處跑

192
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:16,190
I pity the fool who puts on my jewelry! I do! I do!
「我真同情戴這個手飾的人」 「真的」

194
00:11:16,370 --> 00:11:18,400
I pity the fool that...
「我真同情戴這個…」 你好

195
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:23,910
When you were late last night, Kathy and I were talking and...
你昨天晚歸 凱西和我聊了起來

196
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,480
one thing led to another and....
事情演變到後來就…

197
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:29,470
And what? Did you sleep with her?
就什麼？你跟她上床？

198
00:11:29,650 --> 00:11:33,480
-No! No,I just kissed her. -What? That's even worse!
沒有，我只是吻了她 什麼？那樣更糟！

200
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:37,260
-How? -I don't know! But it's the same!
怎麼會更糟？ 我不知道，反正都一樣

201
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:40,860
I have no excuses. I was over the line.
你說得對，我無話可說 我太過分了

202
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,430
Over the line?
過分？

203
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:45,830
You're so far past the line you can't even see it!
你根本就過分到...

204
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:48,020
The line is a dot to you!
連過分見到你都會說你過分

205
00:11:48,770 --> 00:11:51,400
I'm not saying you should magically forgive me.
我不是要你奇跡式的原諒我

206
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:55,170
But you're not perfect. You've made errors in judgment.
但你也不完美 你也做過錯誤的判斷

207
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,530
Name one!
舉個例子

208
00:11:58,010 --> 00:11:59,540
What happened?
怎麼回事？

209
00:12:00,110 --> 00:12:03,520
Man! He promised he wouldn't take the chairs!
他答應不拿沙發椅的

210
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:08,780
How were you locked in? And where the hell's all of our stuff?
怎麼回事？你怎麼會被關進去 我們的東西呢？

211
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:11,280
This guy came to look at the unit...
有一個人來看櫃子 

212
00:12:11,490 --> 00:12:14,890
and he didn't think it was big enough to fit a man.
他說它塞不下一個大人

213
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:17,590
So you got in voluntarily?
所以你就自願進去？

214
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:20,100
I was trying to make a sale!
我想把櫃子賣出去

215
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:24,200
If I ever run into him again, know what I'll do?
要是讓我碰上他 你猜我會怎樣？

216
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:26,100
Bend over?
把屁股翹起來？

217
00:12:27,210 --> 00:12:28,200
There's Lori.
她來了

218
00:12:28,410 --> 00:12:32,810
Remember,no trading. You get the pretty one,I get the mess.
記住，不准交換 美女是你的，失戀女是我的

220
00:12:33,410 --> 00:12:34,880
-Hi,Joey. -Hey.
喬伊

221
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,980
Well,well. Look what you brought.
他就是你帶來的人

222
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:43,050
And what did you bring?
你又帶了誰來？

223
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:46,890
She's checking her coat.
她在寄放外套

224
00:12:47,090 --> 00:12:50,390
Joey,I'm gonna go wash the cab smell off my hands.
喬伊，我要去洗個手

225
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:54,900
Will you get me a white Zinfandel and a glass of red for Janice.
你幫我叫一杯白酒 幫珍妮絲叫一杯紅酒

226
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,300
Janice?
珍妮絲？珍妮絲？

227
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:08,610
Oh,my God!
我…的…天哪

228
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:12,750
Joey's tailor took advantage of me.
喬伊的裁縫吃我豆腐

229
00:13:14,190 --> 00:13:15,210
What?
什麼？

230
00:13:15,590 --> 00:13:18,920
No way. I've been going to the guy for 12 years.
不可能 我找他做了12年衣服

231
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:20,960
You said he'd do my inseam...
拜託啦，他說要量褲管內側

232
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:24,930
then he ran his hand up my leg and then there was...
然後他的手一路摸上來 然後就…

233
00:13:25,130 --> 00:13:26,290
What?
怎樣？

234
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,700
Cupping.
包住了

235
00:13:31,610 --> 00:13:34,510
That's how they do pants!
褲子就是那樣量的

236
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:40,570
-Isn't that how a tailor measures? -Yes,yes,it is. In prison!
羅斯，你告訴他 褲子不都是那樣量的？ 是啊是啊…在監獄裡

238
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:45,620
I said name one!
叫你舉一個就好

239
00:13:54,430 --> 00:13:58,420
-I can't believe I did this. -Stop beating yourself up.
我居然這麼粗心，我真白癡 別再自責了

241
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:02,230
People make mistakes. These things happen.
人都會犯錯，這是難免的

242
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:06,470
There aren't any messages you've forgotten to give me?
你沒有忘記幫我記留言吧？

243
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:09,340
Apparently,you're not very good at it.
是你自己遜

244
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:12,640
-Do you think he'll forgive me? -Of course.
你們覺得他會原諒我嗎？ 當然會
 
245
00:14:12,850 --> 00:14:16,250
The important thing is that you forgive yourself.
但最重要的是 你得原諒自己

246
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:19,220
-You know what,I kind of have. -Already?
其實我已經原諒自己了 這麼快？

247
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:21,950
That was pretty bad what you did.
你犯的錯蠻嚴重的

248
00:14:22,190 --> 00:14:24,050
He will forgive you.
他會原諒你的

249
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:28,750
I like to bring a pad with me when I answer the phone, okay?
我接電話時都會帶便條紙… 好啦

250
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:33,230
-You didn't see how mad he was. -I'm sure he'll forgive you.
你沒看到他氣成什麼樣子  他一定會原諒你的

252
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:37,360
We've all been there. You fight, you make up. That's how it works.
我們都有這種經驗 吵架，和解，就是這樣

254
00:14:37,570 --> 00:14:40,470
It took two people to break up this relationship!
這段感情會破裂是兩個人的錯

255
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:42,700
Yeah! You and that copy girl...
對，你和影印店那個女的 

256
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:45,850
which yesterday you took responsibility for!
你昨天表明願意負責

257
00:14:46,050 --> 00:14:49,020
I didn't know what I was taking responsibility for.
我不知道我負的是什麼責

258
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:51,410
-I didn't finish the letter. -What?
我沒把信看完 什麼？ 

259
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:54,750
-I fell asleep. -You fell asleep?
我睡著了 你睡著了？

261
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:58,720
It was 5:30 in the morning.
當時是早上5點半

262
00:14:58,930 --> 00:15:03,590
And you had rambled on for 18 pages.
你一廢話就廢話了十八頁

263
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,830
Front and back!
正反面都寫滿了

264
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:13,910
And by the way?  Y-O-U, apostrophe R-E means,"you are."
還有 「你得」是指「你必須」

265
00:15:14,110 --> 00:15:16,340
Y-O-U-R means "your."
「你的」是代表所有格

266
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:19,780
I can't believe I thought of getting back together with you.
我居然會想跟你復合 

267
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:21,680
We are so over!
我們根本就完了

268
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:24,850
Fine by me!
無所謂

269
00:15:26,650 --> 00:15:29,850
And just so you know, it's not that common...
順便告訴你 那種事並不常見 

270
00:15:30,060 --> 00:15:33,930
it doesn't happen to every guy, and it is a big deal!
並非男人都會那樣 那是很嚴重的

272
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:36,390
I knew it!
我就知道

273
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:40,930
-You had no right to go out with him. -That's ridiculous..
你沒有權利和他約會 這真是太荒謬…

275
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:43,390
-You sold me out! -I did not!
你出賣我 我沒有出賣你

276
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:47,200
-You did! You sold me.. -Would you let me talk?
-你有！你出賣我...  -讓我說話好嗎？

277
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:51,370
Did you just flick me?
你彈我的額頭嗎？

278
00:15:52,850 --> 00:15:55,250
Well,you wouldn't let me finish and..
你不讓我說完，我很…

279
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:57,150
Stop it!

280
00:15:58,620 --> 00:15:59,850
-Stop. -Stop.

281
00:16:00,050 --> 00:16:03,290
-All right. No,let's not do this. -No!
-好，不要這樣  -不

282
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:06,450
-Happy thoughts. -No!
-想想快樂的事 -不

283
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:09,720
-Happy thoughts. -No!
-快樂的事  -不！

284
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,160
Okay,now I'm gonna kick some ass!
好，我要發威了

285
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:25,580
All right. Now,I will let go if you both stop.
你們住手，我就放手

286
00:16:26,650 --> 00:16:29,010
-Fine. -Fine.
好吧

287
00:16:29,220 --> 00:16:30,680
There we go.
這不就結了

288
00:16:32,250 --> 00:16:36,690
You know what? If we were in prison, you guys would be my bitches.
如果我們在坐牢 你們就是我的嘍囉

289
00:16:44,570 --> 00:16:46,730
Okay, buddy boy, here it is.
兄弟，如何啊

290
00:16:47,470 --> 00:16:51,430
You hide my clothes? I'm wearing everything you own.
你藏我的衣服 我就穿你全部的衣服

291
00:16:51,810 --> 00:16:53,640
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

292
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:59,300
Look at me,I'm Chandler! Could I be wearing any more clothes?
看啊，我是錢德 我穿的衣服夠多吧？

293
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:03,880
Maybe if I wasn't going commando.
因為我去玩野戰遊戲

294
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:11,810
I tell you,it's hot with all this on. I'd better not do any lunges.
穿這麼多衣服真熱 我最好別做弓箭步

296
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,470
Joey?
喬伊？

297
00:18:06,610 --> 00:18:10,210
Got you the Joey special! Two pizzas!
我買了歡樂套餐，有兩個披薩

298
00:18:11,356 --> 00:18:12,448
喬伊？

299
00:18:14,390 --> 00:18:16,450
Hello? Damn it!
你好 又來了

301
00:18:18,690 --> 00:18:19,720
Hello?
你好

302
00:18:20,130 --> 00:18:24,190
No,Joey's not here right now, but I can take a message. I think.
喬伊現在不在 我可以幫你留言…應該吧

303
00:18:25,130 --> 00:18:28,730
He's still got a chance for the part? That's great news!
他還有機會？真是太好了

304
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:33,430
Well,no,obviously not for the actor who was mauled by his dog.
我不是說那位被狗咬傷的演員

305
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:36,730
That's great. I'll give Joey the message.
太好了，我會轉告喬伊，謝謝

306
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,430
Yes!
漂亮

307
00:18:39,350 --> 00:18:40,370
Okay.
好 

308
00:18:40,850 --> 00:18:42,180
Mac...
麥克…

309
00:18:42,850 --> 00:18:44,550
audition...
試鏡…

310
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,350
at 2:00.
2點鐘

311
00:18:48,660 --> 00:18:50,020
Allergy...
過敏…

312
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:51,820
actor...
演員…

313
00:18:52,990 --> 00:18:54,550
attacked.
遭攻擊

314
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:01,930
By dog...
被狗…

315
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:03,740
not...
不是…

316
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:06,600
flowers.
被花

317
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:17,650
-Tell me you got the message. -What message?
-請告訴我你有收到留言 -什麼留言？

318
00:19:17,850 --> 00:19:21,410
The actor playing Mac couldn't do it. They needed you at 2.
要演麥克的演員不能演 他們要你2點過去

320
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:23,780
What? It's 6:00!
什麼？明明是6點

321
00:19:23,990 --> 00:19:26,390
Look! I wrote it on the board!
我有寫在留言板上

322
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:29,260
I wrote it down, then went looking for you!
我寫在留言板上 然後跑遍整個紐約找你

323
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,290
I went to Ross's, the coffee house...
我跑去羅斯家，跑去咖啡館 

324
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:34,300
I went to any place they make sandwiches!
跑去每一個有三明治的地方

325
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:37,800
-I can't believe this,Chandler! -I'm sorry.
怎麼這樣啦 對不起

327
00:19:38,540 --> 00:19:43,500
-I don't know what to say! -You might say congratulations!
-我不知道該說什麼  -那就說恭喜吧

328
00:19:43,710 --> 00:19:47,440
I saw the board, I went to the audition, I got the part!
我看到留言板，跑去試鏡 我中了

329
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:50,780
Was that funny? I was worried.
你覺得很好笑嗎？ 我剛才真的很擔心

330
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:54,250
-I'm sorry. -That fake-out thing is just mean.
有時候這樣騙人真的很惡劣

331
00:19:54,450 --> 00:19:57,910
Oh,I'm sorry. I didn't mean to make you feel bad.
抱歉，我不是故意要害你內疚

332
00:19:58,130 --> 00:19:59,460
Well,that's good.
那就好

333
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:03,430
Because you didn't! And I'm incredibly happy for you!
因為我沒有內疚 我好替你高興

334
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,960
That's mean!
你好惡劣

335
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:09,390
-You had me going! -We could do this all day.
你害我慚愧 再玩就玩不完了 

336
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:11,430
Yeah,you're right.
也對

337
00:20:12,010 --> 00:20:14,570
Let's talk about what a huge star I'm gonna be.
好，我們來聊聊我會有多紅

338
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:16,970
You're gonna be huge! I'm gonna hug you!
你會變成超級大明星

339
00:20:17,210 --> 00:20:19,010
-You hug me! -All right.
我要抱你 來抱吧

340
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:50,810
-Do we do this too much? -I think so.
我們會不會太愛抱了？ 我也覺得

341
00:20:51,010 --> 00:20:52,980
-Yeah. Get off me. -Yeah.
放開我 就是啊

342
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:03,110
"C.H.E.E.S.E., I'm not leaving without you.
吉事，我不會扔下你的

343
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:06,520
Route your backup power source through your CPU."
你從中央處理器 啟動備用電源

344
00:21:06,730 --> 00:21:11,130
"l can't! My circuits are fried! They're fried, I tell you!"
沒辦法，我的電路燒焦了 焦到不能再焦

345
00:21:15,540 --> 00:21:17,440
"Then I'll carry you!"
那我就背你

346
00:21:17,740 --> 00:21:19,730
"That'll be a neat trick..."
好棒的招數啊 

347
00:21:20,770 --> 00:21:23,300
"when you're dead!"
等你死了再說

348
00:21:24,610 --> 00:21:26,140
You don't have to yell.
羅斯，你不必用喊的

349
00:21:26,380 --> 00:21:30,440
There was just an explosion. My hearing would be impaired.
剛才有爆炸，我的聽力會受損

350
00:21:31,590 --> 00:21:33,210
I thought you were great.
我覺得你很棒

351
00:21:33,420 --> 00:21:36,120
For a minute,I was like, "Where'd Ross go?"
剛才我甚至覺得「羅斯呢？」

352
00:21:37,620 --> 00:21:41,220
Thank you. And that first scene where you meet Mac...
謝謝 你和麥克見面的第一場戲…

353
00:21:41,430 --> 00:21:43,330
-Yeah? -Oh,my God. I mean...
怎樣？ 我的天哪

354
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:44,820
And you know what?

355
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:48,470
That's enough for today. Thanks for your help.
今天就到此為止，多謝幫忙

356
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:52,230
-Holding us back. -Totally.
他欺壓新人 就是啊

357
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


358
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

